<title>POLAND: Remak surge leads Polish builders on Wed.</title>
<headline>Remak surge leads Polish builders on Wed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish engineering and construction firm Remak surged 10 percent to 11 zlotys on Wednesday, buoyed by the general bullish outlook for the Polish construction sector this year, traders said.</p>
<p>Four other main market construction firms jumped at least 6.7 percent on Wednesday -- KPBP Bick, Mostostal Zabrze, Budimex and Mostostal Gdansk.</p>
<p>Buying of Remak was strong enough after price-fixing for investors to have their bids reduced.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
